# Staff client auth (Training Manage)

- Browser: [`lib/api.ts`](lib/api.ts) / `authFetch` → Firebase Bearer; after `/me` stores the seat, also send `x-gofast-staff-id` = `training_managers.id`. Sign-in and `/me` probes stay Bearer-only.
- Server dashboard: `verifyFirebaseBearer` → active `training_managers` row by **token `firebaseUid`** ([`lib/auth/training-manager-me.ts`](lib/auth/training-manager-me.ts)).
- Inbound cross-app: [`lib/staff-forward-auth.ts`](lib/staff-forward-auth.ts) accepts Bearer + header for HQ preset import/list.
